OL,3,GNEWSAPlans to turn church into hostel
OL,4,Agiven funding
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to transform a historic church in
OL,7,Fthe North York Moors into a "low-cost
OL,8,Fhostel" have taken a step forward after
OL,9,Ffunding was secured from the National
OL,10,FLottery Heritage Fund.
OL,12,FA grant of #122,760 will go towards the
OL,13,Fproject to turn the Church of St
OL,14,FMichael into accommodation for
OL,15,Fpilgrims, walkers and visitors to the
OL,16,Farea.
OL,18,FThe church, which has been closed since
OL,19,F2024, forms part of the St Aelred's
OL,20,FPilgrim Trail - a 41-mile (66km) route
OL,21,Flinking Helmsley and the churches of
OL,22,FUpper Ryedale with Rievaulx Abbey.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
