OL,3,GNEWSAPlans to turn church into hostel
OL,4,Agiven funding
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Rev Ian Robinson said transforming
OL,7,Fthe church would give it "an
OL,8,Fopportunity to serve people once again,
OL,9,Fwhile protecting and celebrating its
OL,10,Fheritage for future generations".
